[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0010","text":"……\n（好，这个房间看起来也没问题）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0020","text":"（接下来是……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0030","text":"哎呀，这不是Producer吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0040","text":"哦哦，夏叶，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0050","text":"一想到马上就要回去了，总觉得有点依依不舍……\n……就出来散散步。Producer呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0060","text":"我在巡视看看有没有落下什么东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0070","text":"！\n我也来帮忙"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0080","text":"不用，刚好已经巡视完了，没事的\n谢谢你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0090","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0100","text":"哪里，我才要谢谢你呢，Producer"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0102","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0104","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0105","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0106","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0110","text":"我们在开心的时候……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0120","text":"你一定在背后为我们做了很多事吧……\n……真的很感谢你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0130","text":"哈哈，我没做什么大不了的事啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01130000_04_0140","text":"真是的，稍微为自己邀邀功\n骄傲一下也没关系的呀"}]
